    "body": "<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udfe2 Approval recommended\n\nNo active review issues remain for the integration brand-icon changes in the startup details dialog.\n\n**No open issues** \ud83c\udf89\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nAdds integration brand icons to the startup details dialog introduced in #55834, making integrations easier to identify during startup and in the completion summary.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Displays brand icons once a brands access token is available, with dark-mode support.\n- Moves failed integrations\u2019 red alert icons to the end of each row.\n- Applies consistent 24px sizing to brand images.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `src/\u200bdialogs/\u200bstartup-progress/\u200bdialog-startup-progress.ts` | Adds theme-aware brand icons and repositions failure indicators. |\n</details>\n\n<sub>Review effort: Balanced</sub>",
